hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"13","'Ash-hadu 'an lā 'ilāha 'illallāhu waḥdahu lā sharīka lahu wa 'ash-hadu 'anna Muḥammadan `abduhu wa Rasūluhu. I bear witness that none has the right to be worshipped but Allah alone, Who has no partner; and I bear witness that Muhammad is His slave and His Messenger. Reference: Muslim 1/209."
"14","Allāhummaj`alnī minat-tawwābīna waj`alnī minal-mutaṭahhirīn. O Allah, make me among those who turn to You in repentance, and make me among those who are purified. Reference: At-Tirmidhi 1/78. See also Al-Albani, Sahih At- Tirmidhi 1/18"
